  "title": "Loaded Chicken and Potato Casserole",
  "description": "This cheesy, potato-ey casserole is reminiscent of classic loaded potatoes. Potatoes are roasted in a spice mix which packs them with tons of flavor and gives them a beautiful golden coloring.",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda Stanfield"
  ],
