  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "5 large russet potatoes, peeled and chopped",
    "3 tablespoons olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon garlic powder",
    "0.5 tablespoon onion powder",
    "1 teaspoon paprika",
    "0.5 teaspoon black pepper",
    "1 teaspoon kosher salt, divided",
    "6 slices thick-cut bacon",
    "2 cups shredded rotisserie chicken",
    "8 ounces cream cheese, softened",
    "1 cup tap water",
    "0.5 cup sliced scallions, plus more for garnish",
    "2 teaspoons hot sauce",
    "8 ounces shredded Mexican-blend cheese, divided",
    "3 tablespoons sour cream, for serving"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Coat a 9- x 1-inch baking dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine potatoes, olive oil, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, black pepper, and 1/2 teaspoon of salt in a large bowl; toss until evenly coated. Transfer to the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PwUXrXYoAst6YxqoC_N6rtlUBAU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508938-loaded-chicken-and-potato-casserole-ddmfs-step-1-0788-4x3-38342d285ab442b58ec17c3485689d02.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508938/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until potatoes are golden and fork-tender, 25 to 30 minutes. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oATu9GeCirBKIunDp0BMJcwRNQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508938-loaded-chicken-and-potato-casserole-ddmfs-step-4-0848-4x3-d1cb3608d8fb45e4b7730edc21a351b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508938/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook bacon in a large skillet over medium, turning occasionally, until crisp, 10 to 15 minutes. Drain bacon on a paper towel-lined plate; remove and reserve 1 tablespoon drippings from the skillet. When bacon is cool enough to handle, finely chop, and set aside (about 1/2 cup).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same large bowl, combine chicken, cream cheese, water, scallions, hot sauce, 1/4 cup of the bacon pieces, reserved bacon drippings, 1 1/2 cups cheese, and remaining 1/2 teaspoon salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mUVl3enu1G-GK4slws4Ra_vub5k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508938-loaded-chicken-and-potato-casserole-ddmfs-step-3-0844-4x3-e39922d5e7fe4231a102c662bc9a0df0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508938/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold chicken mixture into the potatoes in the casserole until well combined. Sprinkle with remaining 1/2 cup shredded cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3qL0NCOEMRz7085hWFIlCQ95NaI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508938-loaded-chicken-and-potato-casserole-ddmfs-step-6-0852-4x3-ee76416ea47a41239a37ba802cbe1b73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508938/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake until cheese is melted, 10 minutes longer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Set an oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and switch to the oven’s broiler function. Broil on high for 3 minutes or until cheese is bubbling and brown in spots.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with remaining bacon (about 1/4 cup) and additional scallions. Serve with sour cream.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Oi54mLhbJqnWpMAFcvoxOhG0ex0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508938-loaded-chicken-and-potato-casserole-ddmfs-0906-4x3-ea614b51f5304821b572570550c5e897.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508938/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
